      <p begin="00:06.982" end="00:11.508" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:11.508" end="00:14.353" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door</p>
      <p begin="00:14.353" end="00:16.183" ttm:agent="v1">Could you feel my pain anymore</p>
      <p begin="00:16.183" end="00:17.683" ttm:agent="v1">Hook :</p>
