      <p begin="00:19.448" end="00:22.275" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door aye</p>
      <p begin="00:22.275" end="00:24.981" ttm:agent="v1">Could you feel my pain anymore</p>
      <p begin="00:24.981" end="00:27.543" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door aye</p>
      <p begin="00:27.543" end="00:30.372" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door aye</p>
      <p begin="00:30.372" end="00:32.700" ttm:agent="v1">I can't feel my pain anymore</p>
      <p begin="00:32.700" end="00:34.200" ttm:agent="v1">Verse 1:</p>
      <p begin="00:33.088" end="00:35.775" ttm:agent="v1">She give me thousand reasons say goodbye</p>
      <p begin="00:35.775" end="00:38.526" ttm:agent="v1">She got me crazy I almost dead for the ride</p>
      <p begin="00:38.526" end="00:40.598" ttm:agent="v1">You never found the way to set me to the right</p>
      <p begin="00:40.598" end="00:42.098" ttm:agent="v1">I was fall in love</p>
      <p begin="00:42.064" end="00:43.576" ttm:agent="v1">Da you never know</p>
      <p begin="00:43.576" end="00:45.076" ttm:agent="v1">She calling me daddy</p>
      <p begin="00:44.558" end="00:46.300" ttm:agent="v1">I never stop it</p>
      <p begin="00:46.300" end="00:47.800" ttm:agent="v1">Love or waste</p>
      <p begin="00:47.294" end="00:49.540" ttm:agent="v1">I can't forget it</p>
      <p begin="00:49.540" end="00:52.766" ttm:agent="v1">It's too cold outta door aye</p>
      <p begin="00:52.766" end="00:55.345" ttm:agent="v1">Could you treat me right?</p>
      <p begin="00:55.345" end="00:57.653" ttm:agent="v1">I can't feel my pain anymore</p>
      <p begin="00:57.653" end="01:00.414" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door</p>
      <p begin="01:00.414" end="01:03.014" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door</p>
      <p begin="01:03.014" end="01:05.175" ttm:agent="v1">I can't feel my pain anymore</p>
      <p begin="01:05.175" end="01:06.675" ttm:agent="v1">Say</p>
      <p begin="01:05.923" end="01:07.877" ttm:agent="v1">Say goodbye I should tell her</p>
      <p begin="01:07.877" end="01:09.377" ttm:agent="v1">And we've done that</p>
      <p begin="01:08.490" end="01:09.990" ttm:agent="v1">Babe</p>
      <p begin="01:09.130" end="01:11.154" ttm:agent="v1">It's over</p>
      <p begin="01:11.154" end="01:13.738" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door</p>
      <p begin="01:13.738" end="01:16.588" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door aye</p>
      <p begin="01:16.588" end="01:19.208" ttm:agent="v1">Could you feel my pain anymore</p>
      <p begin="01:19.208" end="01:21.937" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door aye</p>
      <p begin="01:21.937" end="01:24.705" ttm:agent="v1">Its too cold outta door aye</p>
      <p begin="01:24.705" end="01:26.867" ttm:agent="v1">I can't feel my pain anymore</p>
      <p begin="01:26.867" end="01:28.367" ttm:agent="v1">verse2:</p>
      <p begin="01:27.305" end="01:28.848" ttm:agent="v1">那些都是她的借口</p>
      <p begin="01:28.848" end="01:32.218" ttm:agent="v1">Its cold 没人能够填补我的裂缝</p>
      <p begin="01:32.218" end="01:34.269" ttm:agent="v1">我的背全是她的抓痕</p>
      <p begin="01:34.269" end="01:36.848" ttm:agent="v1">可她不再满足因为她是一个猎人</p>
      <p begin="01:36.848" end="01:38.968" ttm:agent="v1">一切都快</p>
      <p begin="01:38.968" end="01:40.468" ttm:agent="v1">U used to be mine</p>
      <p begin="01:40.232" end="01:41.732" ttm:agent="v1">覆水难收</p>
      <p begin="01:41.702" end="01:43.202" ttm:agent="v1">怎么够</p>
      <p begin="01:42.903" end="01:44.403" ttm:agent="v1">她的眼睛</p>
      <p begin="01:43.731" end="01:45.622" ttm:agent="v1">Told me that time i like a beast</p>
      <p begin="01:45.622" end="01:47.122" ttm:agent="v1">But now I can't stop</p>
      <p begin="01:46.772" end="01:49.816" ttm:agent="v1">插得深 才能插到底</p>
      <p begin="01:49.816" end="01:51.316" ttm:agent="v1">We tripping</p>
      <p begin="01:51.216" end="01:52.716" ttm:agent="v1">Why are u leaving</p>
      <p begin="01:52.555" end="01:55.403" ttm:agent="v1">But I cant stop</p>
      <p begin="01:55.403" end="01:57.373" ttm:agent="v1">When u treat me up</p>
      <p begin="01:57.373" end="02:00.159" ttm:agent="v1">U will be my paradise</p>
      <p begin="02:00.159" end="02:02.107" ttm:agent="v1">Nah all ur promise</p>
      <p begin="02:02.107" end="02:03.607" ttm:agent="v1">Nah</p>
      <p begin="02:02.834" end="02:04.775" ttm:agent="v1">全部都被摧毁</p>
      <p begin="02:04.775" end="02:06.275" ttm:agent="v1">U can feel my</p>
      <p begin="02:06.174" end="02:07.674" ttm:agent="v1">U can feel my</p>
      <p begin="02:07.536" end="02:09.036" ttm:agent="v1">U can feel my</p>
      <p begin="02:08.842" end="02:10.824" ttm:agent="v1">Pain!</p>
      <p begin="02:10.824" end="02:13.443" ttm:agent="v1">Could you feel that anymore?</p>
      <p begin="02:13.443" end="02:15.544" ttm:agent="v1">Could you feel my pain anymore? !</p>
